OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is it so hard to reapply for a
OL,4,Ablue badge?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amputee told the BBC this week how
OL,7,Fhe was shocked and "disheartened" to
OL,8,Fdiscover he needed more than
OL,9,Fphotographic evidence of his missing
OL,10,Fleg to renew his blue badge.
OL,12,FAfter Nigel Ward, 71, from King's Lynn,
OL,13,Fwent public with the story, Lindsey
OL,14,FChant, from Northampton, and Julie,
OL,15,Ffrom Southend-on-Sea, Essex, used Your
OL,16,FVoice to get in touch with the BBC
OL,17,Fabout similar struggles.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
