OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is it so hard to reapply for a
OL,4,Ablue badge?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlue badges are disabled parking cards
OL,7,Fissued by local authorities to help
OL,8,Fpeople with mobility issues park closer
OL,9,Fto the goods and services they need to
OL,10,Fuse.
OL,12,FSo why are people, some of whose
OL,13,Fconditions have worsened over time,
OL,14,Fstruggling to reapply for their blue
OL,15,Fbadges - and who is eligible?
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
